==================================================
# Existing Project Architecture
==================================================

项目定位：

Linux Device Runtime Supervisor


Runtime负责：

- Process lifecycle
- Service health
- Device state
- Recovery coordination
- IPC
- Resource monitoring
- MCU communication health supervision


Runtime不负责：

- Camera
- V4L2业务
- RKNN
- 控制算法
- MCU控制协议
- UART framing
- CRC
- HELLO negotiation
- actuator logic


核心原则：

Runtime manages business.

Runtime does not implement business.


